Loaded `references/configuration.md` and `references/traps.md`. In VSCode, language-specific formatter settings take precedence over global settings.
Add this to `.vscode/settings.json`:
```json
{
  "editor.formatOnSave": true,
  "[javascript]": {
    "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
  },
  "[javascriptreact]": {
    "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
  }
}
```
Also verify that the Prettier extension is installed and enabled for the workspace.
